    "Package-manager download caches (npm, Yarn, pnpm, Bun, Cargo, Gradle, SwiftPM, uv, and more). They are re-downloaded when needed. Model weights and dependency repositories are never touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download-Caches von Paketmanagern (npm, Yarn, pnpm, Bun, Cargo, Gradle, SwiftPM, uv und mehr). Sie werden bei Bedarf erneut geladen. Modellgewichte und Abhängigkeits-Repositorys bleiben immer unberührt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cachés de descarga de gestores de paquetes (npm, Yarn, pnpm, Bun, Cargo, Gradle, SwiftPM, uv y más). Se vuelven a descargar cuando hace falta. Nunca se tocan los pesos de modelos ni los repositorios de dependencias."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paket yöneticisi indirme önbellekleri (npm, Yarn, pnpm, Bun, Cargo, Gradle, SwiftPM, uv ve daha fazlası). Gerektiğinde yeniden indirilirler. Model ağırlıklarına ve bağımlılık depolarına asla dokunulmaz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
